WARRANTY DISCLAIMER — READ BEFORE PRODUCTION USE
================================================================================

This software generates and validates infrastructure-as-code. It does not apply
it, and it must not be treated as a substitute for security review, architecture
review, or professional judgement.

The catalog is version 0.1.0 and has NOT been through human review. Roughly half
its controls cite an AWS best-practice page that was not read during authoring;
the requirement text in those cases is the authors' synthesis. See
VERIFICATION.md for a measured account.

A "satisfied" control means a check passed or a vetted module was composed. It
does not mean the resulting architecture is secure, available, or compliant with
any regulation.
